# Publish lexmora-webui on Irancell-T3

Date: 2026-08-12

## Deploy

- Script: `.armin/docker-scripts/run-on-docker-server.ps1`
- Stack: `lexmora-webui` on `t3-net`, no host publish
- Volume dir: `/home/cloud-admin/docker/lexmora-webui`
- Image: `lexmora-webui:latest` (local build → save → SCP → load)

## Public URL

https://lexmora.xaigrok.ir

## Verify

- HAProxy SNI → `lexmora-webui:80` — HTTP 200
- TLS issuer: Let's Encrypt
- Login via `/api/v1/auth/login` proxy → 200 (API on same `t3-net`)

